{"id":"1989ed1d02ace2f1","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-bound-variable.md","title":"Bound variables (legacy)","display":"df-bound-variable — Bound variables (legacy)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-bound-variable","aliases":["27-df-bound-variable"],"display":"df-bound-variable — Bound variables (legacy)","depends_on":["[[27-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-bound-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-bound-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bound-variable — Bound variables (legacy)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" href=\"?note=1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" title=\"27-df-formula\">27-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" href=\"?note=1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" title=\"27-df-formula\">27-df-formula</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>。引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BV}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var})\">\\(\\mathrm{BV}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var})\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BV}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\\mathrm{BV}(\\neg\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}(\\varphi),\\qquad\\mathrm{BV}(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{BV}(\\psi),\\qquad\\mathrm{BV}(Qx\\,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BV}(\\alpha)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\\mathrm{BV}(\\neg\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}(\\varphi),\\qquad\\mathrm{BV}(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{BV}(\\psi),\\qquad\\mathrm{BV}(Qx\\,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}(\\varphi)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件是目录遗留的一阶逻辑背景（legacy background），不是《Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications》的书内对应原子。本次保留其概念接口并修复类型、绑定和依赖；未取得该书的对应定义或页码，不声称依据原书核验。</li>\n<li>补足旧稿未约束的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ,Q,x,\\alpha\">\\(\\circ,Q,x,\\alpha\\)</span>。本接口记录出现在量词绑定位置的变量，允许空泛量化；一个变量也可能在同一公式中既自由又被绑定，不以整体变量集合减 FV 代替递归。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1f9e71c9f1e5764e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1f9e71c9f1e5764e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\mathrm{